{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAVKERMAN X is a Single Player, Post Apocalyptic, open world, First person Shooter, immersive sim with an emphasis on exploration, high risk / high reward combat, player choice, and interaction with characters, the story, and the environment. You are the Havkerman, an undead humanoid risen by the spirit of the wasteland to prevent it's destruction. Along your journey you will meet many characters, good and bad, and decide their futures as you decide to assist them or harm them in their plights. Explore the open world and collect new weapons, and augmentations to aid you in your journey.\u00a0 HAVKERMAN X includes a campaign with a branching story, quests, locations and multiple endings as well as an optional set of tactical missions which take place separately from the story and open world.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645540?t=1773174448","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645540?t=1773174448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645540/beff6d2741bfceba52e6a2219a51ac7644094bd3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773174448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645540/beff6d2741bfceba52e6a2219a51ac7644094bd3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773174448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Customers should know that this game will contain blood, and violence, occasional swearing, and characters using tobacco"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAVKERMAN X is a Single Player, Post Apocalyptic, open world, First person Shooter, immersive sim with an emphasis on exploration, high risk / high reward combat, player choice, and interaction with 